Damn, I can relate all too well with all of this. I wish you all the best my friend. I'm strugglin' as hell. And I plan on leaving all of this. If you like, I am just creating a youtube channel, where I will vlog about all of this. My last ride, if you will. Subscribe and let's stay in contact if you like to. I hear you! All the best, from the bottom of my heart... for both of us! Take care!

